-- INTERFACE occurrence 4/4: a SUPERINTERFACE (`Super`, via `checkSuper`).
--
-- `Super` carries `superParams : List String` — type-parameter NAMES, not `Ty`s —
-- so the node has no `Ty` position and therefore no span anywhere in the AST to
-- borrow, and this row is unlocated.  That residual is structural and pre-existing
-- (the sibling `UnknownInterface` at this same site is unlocated for the identical
-- reason); reporting it unlocated beats not reporting a genuine use site at all.
